{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-15-1","title":"Psalms 15:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David describes a citizen of Zion.</p>\n<p>Lord. 1:1-4; 23:6; 21:3-5; 27:4; 61:4; 84:4; 92:13; Joh 3:3-5; 14:3; 17:24 Re 7:14-17; 21:3,4,23,24 abide. Heb. sojourn. holy. 2:6; 3:4; 43:3,4; 87:1-3; Heb 12:22; Re 14:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-15-2","title":"Psalms 15:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>He. 84:11; Pr 2:7,8; 28:18; Isa 33:15; Mic 2:7; Lu 1:6; Ga 2:14; 1Jo 2:6 worketh. Ac 10:35; Ro 2:10; Eph 2:10; Heb 11:33; 1Jo 2:29; 3:7; Re 22:14,15 speaketh. 34:12,13; Isa 63:8; Zec 8:16,17; Eph 4:25; Col 3:9; Re 21:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-15-3","title":"Psalms 15:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>backbiteth. 101:5-8; Ex 23:1-33; Le 19:16; Jer 9:4-9; Ro 1:30; Tit 3:2 Jas 4:11; 1Pe 2:1,2 doeth. 1Sa 24:11; Isa 56:2; Mt 7:12; Ro 12:17; 13:10; 3Jo 1:11 taketh up. or, receiveth or, endureth. Pr 22:10; 25:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-15-4","title":"Psalms 15:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>a vile. 101:4; 2Ki 3:13,14; Es 3:2; Job 32:21,22; Isa 32:5,6; Da 5:17-31 Ac 24:2,3,25; Jas 2:1-9 but. 16:3; 101:6; 119:63; Mt 12:49,50; 1Jo 3:14 sweareth. Jos 9:18-20; Jud 11:35; 2Sa 21:1,2; Mt 5:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-15-5","title":"Psalms 15:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>putteth. Ex 22:25; Le 25:35-37; De 23:19,20; Ne 5:2-5,7-13; Eze 18:8,17 Eze 22:12 nor taketh. Ex 23:7,8; De 16:19; Isa 33:15; Mic 7:3; Mt 26:15; 27:3-5 He that doeth. 16:8; 55:22; 106:3; 112:6; Pr 12:3; Eze 18:27; Mt 7:21-25; Joh 13:17 Jas 1:22-25; 2Pe 1:10,11</p>"}]}